{"availability":"available","full":"antoinebou12/uml-mcp","name":"uml-mcp","description":"UML-MCP Server is a UML diagram generation tool based on MCP (Model Context Protocol), which can help users generate various types of UML diagrams through natural language description or directly writing PlantUML and Mermaid and Kroki https://uml-mcp.vercel.app/mcp","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":105,"forks":28,"created":"2025-04-01T02:10:30Z","updated":"2026-10-09T03:12:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://antoinebou12.github.io/uml-mcp/","topics":["mcp","uml"],"demo":"https://antoinebou12.github.io/uml-mcp/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:50.360Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:50.360Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:50.360Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:36:50.360Z","stars":105,"forks":28}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["UML-MCP gives an AI assistant a real diagram tool instead of asking it to fake diagrams in Markdown. Connect it once over MCP, then ask for a class diagram, sequence diagram, architecture view, Mermaid flowchart, D2 graph, BPMN process, or another Kroki-backed format. The server validates the source, renders it, and returns a URL, playground link, or inline image.","It also works as a building block for agent-facing products. Use MCP when an agent needs diagram tools, AG-UI when a frontend needs a standard event stream, and OpenUI when the product should turn model output into interactive, application-owned UI components. These layers complement each other; UML-MCP stays focused on diagram generation.","Chat reply shape: diagram preview · URL · Playground (mermaid.live)"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoinebou12/uml-mcp/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e44fe34e8b51db4e6e3ad6c4392973568c7f6b419c4f0e2744784f3f48944d66","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:50.491Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:5